@flexiarg operator/go-to-the-next-leaf-now
@title Say 'Set Up And Run The Leaf N Experiment' To Start The Next Item In An Agreed Sequence
@status accepted 2026-11-11: proposed by 象 for 2 turns (Joe 2026-11-11: recurrence suffices); attested once used in a mission or a War Machine cascade
@provenance 象 proposals, ~/.emacs-graph/session-turn-analysis/<record>[.json].candidates.json; records: turn-v7b1LN turn-wRwbuI; first proposed for: A leaf-by-leaf sequence was agreed (hPZS7C) and leaf 1 has reported.
@why [snatch/probe-before-committing]

! conclusion: name the leaf and say set up and run

  + IF:
    the plan is settled and the next leaf is next in line

  + HOWEVER:
    re-describing the whole plan each time wastes a turn and invites changes

  + THEN:
    name the leaf and say set up and run

  + BECAUSE:
    the agreed plan carries the details, so one line is enough
